  "description": "The uncrewed Roscosmos Progress 94 cargo spacecraft docked to the Poisk Module March 24 after launching to the International Space Station from the Baikonur Cosmodrome in Kazakhstan March 22 on a Soyuz booster rocket. Progress is filled with nearly three tons of supplies and cargo and will remain docked to the space station for approximately six months.  Join NASA as we go forward to the Moon and on to Mars -- discover the latest on Earth, the Solar System and beyond with a weekly update in your inbox.  Subscribe at: https://www.nasa.gov/subscribe",
